  _Latest expansion will provide Anthropic with multiple gigawatts of TPU capacity_
  
  SUNNYVALE, Calif., April 6, 2026 / [PRNewswire](http://www.prnewswire.com/)/ -- Anthropic today announced an expansion of its use of TPU chips and cloud services, as it scales its development of foundation models, agents, and enterprise applications.
  
  [![Google Cloud Logo (PRNewsfoto/Google Cloud)](https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/1032194/Google_Cloud_Logo.jpg)](https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/1032194/Google_Cloud_Logo.html)
  
